<mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Decision boundary:&lt;/b&gt; the Investigator agent reads through read-only tools and returns a proposal. The decision functions are private to the Orchestrator, re-fetch policy, pack, signals and identifiers from the system of record, and are the only roles that can write a decision. Outcomes are AUTO_APPROVED or ROUTED_TO_ADJUSTER. Coverage failures, evidence mismatches, risk signals, errors and timeouts all route to an adjuster. Claim and evidence are untrusted input. Submit is asynchronous: the API returns 202 and the console polls." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="980" width="1500" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
